<title>CHINA: China 1996 kerosene output up 21.56 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>China 1996 kerosene output up 21.56 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>China produced 5.29 million tonnes of kerosene in 1996, up 21.56 percent from 1995, the State Statistical Bureau said on Monday.</p>
<p>Kerosene output in December alone was 462,400 tonnes, the bureau said.</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532 1921</p>
</text>
